<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed mixed in very heavy trading on Friday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones industrial average rose 19.45 to 7,796.51, a record. For the week it rose 14.47 points.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite index rose 0.08 to 467.84, a record. For the week it rose 2.67.</p>
<p>The average price per share ended unchanged.</p>
<p>Decliners beat advancers 1,479 to 1,101.</p>
<p>Volume was 652,725,670 compared with 536,921,460 on Thursday. Weekly volume was 2,646,225,670.</p>
